min_slic3r_version = 2.9.0
0.1.0 Initial experimental left-extruder Hyper Speed bundle. Start/end G-code copied from ideaMaker 5.4.2.8790. Not production-ready.
0.2.0 Dual-extruder printer (T0+T1 electronic lift). Heat/purge gated by is_extruder_used. Slicer XY offset is 0; firmware keeps the ~25 mm X offset. Not production-ready.
0.2.1 Dual print profile keeps wipe tower off. PrusaSlicer wipe tower requires relative E; ideaMaker start G-code is M82 / absolute E.
0.3.0 Print profile is Prusa XL IS 0.20 SPEED layout and speeds, clipped to Pro2 Hyper FFF L1 (150 mm/s, 5000 mm/s2, 15 mm3/s). Travel stays 150 mm/s as confirmed on this machine.
0.3.1 Dual printer only. Left-only printer and print presets removed. Unused tools still skipped with is_extruder_used.
0.4.0 XL-style 0.4 mm print family (0.10 DETAIL, 0.15/0.20/0.25 SPEED and STRUCTURAL, 0.28 DRAFT) plus Generic PETG/ABS/ASA/FLEX. Speeds and volumetric flow still clipped to Hyper FFF L1. Not production-ready.
0.4.1 Configuration Wizard filament is Generic PLA only. Unused PETG/ABS/ASA/FLEX presets removed.
0.4.2 Dual tool-change G-code no longer indexes temperature[previous_extruder] (previous_extruder is -1 on the first change).
0.5.0 Dual start, park/standby tool-change, and end matched to ideaMaker Multicolor.gcode. Standby 180 C, park X30 Y295, 11 mm toolchange retract. Wipe tower still off (absolute E).
0.5.1 Wipe tower is PrusaSlicer's (relative E / M83). Removed hardcoded tool-change park XY from Multicolor.gcode.
0.5.2 Arrange spacing default 6 mm. Supports use current extruder so enabling supports does not disable the wipe tower.
0.5.3 Wipe tower matches XL IS: 25 deg cone, 3 mm brim, 8 mm bridging, 150% purge spacing. Prime all extruders off (independent dual heads, not MMU).
0.5.4 G-code thumbnails off so PrusaSlicer does not put 600+ comment lines before M99123. After export, run scripts/ensure_m99123_first.py so M99123 is physically line 1 (PrusaSlicer still prepends "; generated by").
0.5.5 Start G-code filament names are [Raise3D] PLA to match ideaMaker and the names loaded on this printer.
0.5.6 Generic PLA nozzle 230 C and extrusion_multiplier 0.94 from this machine's ideaMaker [Raise3D] PLA files. Bed stays 60 C.
0.5.7 Generic PLA nozzle 215/225 C and multiplier 1.00 from the operator's proven Prusa PLA. Idle 70 C is a filament setting only; dual standby G-code stays 180 C.
0.5.8 Dual bed texture marks leftmost 25 mm as T1 keep-out (firmware X offset; slicer offset stays 0). Default wipe tower X50 Y140. validate_gcode flags T1 X < 25 mm between M1001 and M1002.
0.5.9 Print accel 2000 and travel/first-layer 5000 from ideaMaker Multicolor SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT. ensure_m99123_first.py converts PrusaSlicer M204 S to SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT. Validator rejects leftover M204.
0.5.10 ensure_m99123_first.py inserts M104 next-tool preheat ~400 lines before each swap M109 (ideaMaker Multicolor). next_extruder is not available in layer G-code.
0.5.11 Right-only start branch uses the full Multicolor T1 in-place prime (E10 then E-11), not blob-only. compare_gcode.py uses left vs dual/right marker sets.
0.5.12 Right-only matches ideaMaker RightonlyExtruder.gcode: heat/select T1, home on T1, same X20 Y0 wipe as left (not dual E10/E-11). End G-code skips unused-tool M221/M104; single-tool adds bare M104 S0.
0.5.13 Authoritative ideaMaker sources are LeftonlyExtruder, RightonlyExtruder, and MulticolorRaise3d (replacing conradfreeman orange / Multicolor). Start/end/tool-change sequences unchanged. Dual wipe-tower octagon in this file is ~X50 Y241 (T1 min X 27.3); preheat-to-M109 gaps 64-2200 lines (median 762).
0.5.14 Escape [Raise3D] PLA in custom G-code as {"[Raise3D] PLA"} so PrusaSlicer does not treat [Raise3D] as a placeholder. Exported comments are still [Raise3D] PLA.
0.5.15 Print post_process runs ensure_m99123_first.py then validate_gcode.py (this machine's Python 3.13 and repo paths). Validator failure aborts export.
0.5.16 Print post_process uses C:\\Windows\\py.exe -3 (latest installed Python 3) instead of a pinned C:\\Python313\\python.exe. Script paths stay C:\\Repos\\Raise3D-Prusa-Slicer\\scripts\\.
0.5.17 Filament preset is PLA Raise3D (same name on Plater and Filament settings). Replaces Generic PLA @Raise3D Pro2 Plus HS.
0.5.18 Add PETG/TPU/ASA/PA-CF/ABS-GF Raise3D from operator XL temps. Filaments compatible only with this Dual 0.4 printer. RaiseTouch names are [Raise3D] plus filament_type.
0.5.19 Filament cost and spool_weight match the operator XL Generic-derived presets.
0.5.23 Drop {max_layer_z} from start G-code (not valid there). Bounding Box Z is filled by post-process from layer ;Z: tags.
0.5.24 RaiseTouch times go immediately before ;LAYER:N (ideaMaker). Do not attach them to PrusaSlicer's ;LAYER_CHANGE.
0.5.25 Layer 0 remaining uses footer seconds (not M73 minute rounding). Bounding box XY from print moves after M1001. Copy slicer ;HEIGHT: after ;LAYER:N/;Z: — never HEIGHT in custom G-code (PrusaSlicer reserved keyword).
0.5.26 First layer follows XL IS 0.4: 40 mm/s walls and infill, 500 mm/s2 accel (was ideaMaker travel 5000). SPEED vs STRUCTURAL later-layer speeds unchanged; STRUCTURAL also uses XL external-perimeter accel 1500.
0.5.27 XL short-travel accel 250 and Z travel 12 (were missing, so ideaMaker 5000 XY travel leaked into hops/Z). Clear MK2S MMU cooling-tube leftovers. Raft first-layer feed 30.
0.5.28 Filament cooling, PETG/TPU retract, and TPU/PA-CF volumetric match operator XL presets, clipped to Hyper FFF L1 (15 mm3/s) and E feedrate 40 mm/s. Dual standby G-code stays 180 C.
0.5.29 First-layer infill speed is XL 100 mm/s (was 40). The 0.5.26 slowdown was a policy extra after the 5000 accel bug; 100 mm/s is under Hyper FFF L1. First-layer walls stay 40 mm/s / 500 mm/s2.
0.5.30 Repo is a multi-printer tree. Post-process scripts live at C:\\Repos\\Prusa-Slicer-Print-Profiles\\Raise3D\\scripts\\.
0.5.31 Sequential clearance height 80 mm (operator Copperhead; ideaMaker stock Pro2 Plus HS gantry is 65). Radius still 45 (PrusaSlicer cylinder; ideaMaker uses a per-nozzle box).
0.5.32 Sequential clearance radius 90 mm from operator Copperhead + fan measurements (back cable chain ~88; T0 right shroud 70). Cylinder still cannot match the per-nozzle box.
0.5.33 Sequential Y from operator ruler: front 50 mm, body back 30 mm. Radius 70 mm (T0 right shroud). Height 80.
0.5.34 Sequential clearance radius 85 mm (margin on the T0 front-right corner ~86).
0.5.35 Sequential clearance radius 90 mm so the whole head (T0 front-right ~86) sits inside the cylinder.
0.5.36 Single 0.20mm Hyper Speed print profile from this machine's ideaMaker jobs. Drops the XL SPEED/STRUCTURAL/DETAIL/DRAFT family. PLA back to 230 C / 0.94 flow. First layer 0.30 mm at 50 mm/s. Not production-ready.
0.5.37 ideaMaker pass: unretract 25 mm/s (F1500), support 120, small/overhang walls 75, full retract before wipe. Wipe stays on (ideaMaker G0 F3600 ;WIPE).
0.5.38 Default infill is adaptive cubic (was grid). Density still 15%.
0.5.39 PLA first layer 215 C (later layers stay 230 C).
0.5.40 After purge at Z15, travel to first print XY then drop Z (ideaMaker). PrusaSlicer was dropping Z at the purge.
0.5.41 PLA later layers 225 C (first layer stays 215 C).
0.5.42 PLA Raise3D filament start G-code sets Klipper pressure advance 0.05 (operator T0 Garethky pattern). Other materials unchanged.
0.5.43 PLA PA 0.068 from operator T0 Ellis corner pattern (replaces 0.05 from the Garethky line test).
0.5.44 PLA extrusion multiplier 1.00 from operator Ellis EM cubes (replaces ideaMaker 0.94).
0.5.45 Print accel from Compensation Test.gcode: walls/infill/first 5000, solid/top 2000, travel 5000. PLA cooling floor min_print_speed 100 (ideaMaker Standard PLA).
0.5.46 PLA matches ideaMaker Standard: 230 C, M221 S94, extrusion_multiplier 1.00 (not double-counted). Post-process first-layer FLOW 90% / top FLOW 106%. Drop Ellis PA 0.068 emit.
0.5.47 Elephant foot 0.15 mm (ideaMaker -0.15 contours; PrusaSlicer positive inset).
0.5.48 Elephant foot 0.20 mm (was 0.15; PrusaSlicer positive inset, so holes also open ~0.20).
